      "id": 14638007,
      "title": "[net,14/14] netfilter: nft_meta_bridge: fix NFT_META_BRI_IIFPVID stack leak",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620222738.112506-15-pablo@netfilter.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-15-pablo@netfilter.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-15-pablo@netfilter.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "f0998f966fe7f0be267d375bd551f0abdfa74b0c",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pablo Neira Ayuso",
      "date": "2026-06-20T22:27:38",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 nft_meta_bridge 模块中 NFT_META_BRI_IIFPVID 操作的栈泄漏漏洞。原代码调用 br_vlan_get_pvid_rcu() 获取端口 PVID 后未检查返回值，若函数失败则 p_pvid 未被初始化，导致未初始化栈数据被写入 nft 寄存器并可能被规则后续匹配使用，造成信息泄漏。补丁通过检查 br_vlan_get_pvid_rcu() 的返回值，非零时跳转至 err 路径，从而避免栈泄漏。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "网桥",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14638006,
      "title": "[net,13/14] netfilter: nf_conntrack_expect: use conntrack GC to reap expectations",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620222738.112506-14-pablo@netfilter.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-14-pablo@netfilter.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-14-pablo@netfilter.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "3268a249993233f3b21ba0904ea29ac668705add",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pablo Neira Ayuso",
      "date": "2026-06-20T22:27:37",
      "summary": "该补丁是 netfilter 连接跟踪（conntrack）预期连接（expectation）机制的垃圾回收重构。原本 expectation 使用独立的 timer_list 定时器到期删除，现改为复用已有的 conntrack GC worker 进行集中回收。将 struct timer_list timeout 改为 u32 timeout 记录到期时间戳，在 GC 遍历主连接 expectation 链表时通过 nf_ct_exp_is_expired() 判断是否过期。同时利用 IPS_HELPER_BIT 标记需要 GC 的连接，跳过未确认和 dying 状态的条目。该改动消除了对 expectation 的额外 refcount 增减操作，修复了 timer_del() 误报导致访问已释放的 exp->master 指针的竞态问题，并新增 NF_CT_EXPECT_DEAD 标志位供并发安全使用。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14638005,
      "title": "[net,12/14] netfilter: nf_reject: skip iphdr options when looking for icmp header",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620222738.112506-13-pablo@netfilter.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-13-pablo@netfilter.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-13-pablo@netfilter.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "ec602bee6a4671f22983ea339e6a8fc077739068",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pablo Neira Ayuso",
      "date": "2026-06-20T22:27:36",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 nf_reject_ipv4 模块中 nf_skb_is_icmp_unreach() 函数的一个 bug。在判断 skb 是否为 ICMP 不可达报文时，原代码使用 sizeof(*iph)（即基础 IP 头长度 20 字节）来计算传输层偏移，但未考虑 IP 选项的存在。当 IP 报文带有选项时（头部长度 > 20），thoff 计算错误会导致对 ICMP type 字段的定位出错，函数返回随机结果，可能错误地将普通 ICMP 报文当成 ICMP 不可达错误报文处理。补丁将 sizeof(*iph) 替换为 ip_hdrlen(skb)，使用真实 IP 头长度，确保在存在 IP 选项时也能正确识别 ICMP 报文类型。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14638004,
      "title": "[net,11/14] netfilter: nft_flow_offload: zero device address for non-ether case",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620222738.112506-12-pablo@netfilter.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-12-pablo@netfilter.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-12-pablo@netfilter.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "46ac761974ee7bcf4c64b3db05e899c64e9c9732",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pablo Neira Ayuso",
      "date": "2026-06-20T22:27:35",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 nft_flow_offload 中 nft_dev_fill_forward_path() 函数的一个 bug：当遇到非以太网设备时提前 goto out，但未初始化栈上的硬件地址数组 ha，导致未初始化的栈数据传播到 dev_fill_forward_path()。补丁在跳过非以太网设备时调用 eth_zero_addr(ha) 清零该数组，避免依赖后续 ndo_fill_forward_path 回调自行修复。此修改保障了非 PPP 等非以太网场景下转发路径查找的正确性，防止潜在的内存未初始化信息泄露。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14638003,
      "title": "[net,10/14] netfilter: nft_meta_bridge: add validate callback for get operations",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620222738.112506-11-pablo@netfilter.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-11-pablo@netfilter.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-11-pablo@netfilter.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "4847e473f379768381c7e7b3abb649d819c26db3",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pablo Neira Ayuso",
      "date": "2026-06-20T22:27:34",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 nftables bridge 元数据模块（nft_meta_bridge）中 NFT_META_BRI_IIFHWADDR 验证回调的错误归类。原先这个 get 类型操作被错误地放在 set validate 回调中，导致当输入设备为 NULL 时可能从 bridge skb->cb[] 越界读取 4 字节。补丁新增 nft_meta_get_validate 函数，将该 key 正确移至 get validate 回调，并将其限定在 NF_BR_PRE_ROUTING hook 上执行，从而避免越界读取风险，提升 netfilter 桥接元数据获取操作的安全性。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "网桥"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14638000,
      "title": "[net,08/14] netfilter: ipset: make sure gc is properly stopped",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620222738.112506-9-pablo@netfilter.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-9-pablo@netfilter.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-9-pablo@netfilter.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "a19bd116f9eebf7aac7a7effd6fc7d467836d1ca",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pablo Neira Ayuso",
      "date": "2026-06-20T22:27:32",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 netfilter ipset 子模块在销毁集合时垃圾回收（GC）可能未被正确停止的问题。原代码使用 cancel_delayed_work_sync() 取消 GC 延迟工作，但 GC 函数中 queue_delayed_work() 无条件重新排队，可能导致 GC 未被彻底关闭。改用 disable_delayed_work_sync() 确保在销毁集合时 GC 不会再被重新调度，从而正确关闭垃圾回收机制，避免潜在的资源泄漏或竞态问题。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14638001,
      "title": "[net,07/14] netfilter: ipset: fix order of kfree_rcu() and rcu_assign_pointer()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260620222738.112506-8-pablo@netfilter.org",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-8-pablo@netfilter.org/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260620222738.112506-8-pablo@netfilter.org/mbox/",
      "hash": "71087aa93f37768a09d10bd61a1f07fd8361403a",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pablo Neira Ayuso",
      "date": "2026-06-20T22:27:31",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 netfilter/ipset 子系统中 RCU 操作的顺序错误。原代码在 ip_set_init_comment 和 ip_set_comment_free 函数中先调用 kfree_rcu() 释放 comment 扩展对象，后调用 rcu_assign_pointer() 将指针置为 NULL，这会导致并发读者在指针尚未清除前就访问到已释放的内存，存在 UAF 风险。正确顺序应先用 rcu_assign_pointer() 将 comment->c 置为 NULL，阻止后续读者访问该指针，再调用 kfree_rcu() 延迟释放内存，确保所有 RCU 读端临界区结束后才真正回收对象。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14637997,
