    {
      "id": 14637675,
      "title": "[net,v5] net: airoha: Fix skb->priority underflow in airoha_dev_select_queue()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/178194366700.2485734.5368768965976693502@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178194366700.2485734.5368768965976693502@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/178194366700.2485734.5368768965976693502@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "0cb2c8cc011809e91c953a3dcd1683bbe456aaaa",
      "commitRef": "86e51aa24686cc95bb35613059e8b94b9b81e3f0",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Wayen Yan",
      "date": "2026-06-20T08:17:44",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Airoha 以太网驱动 airoha_dev_select_queue() 中的 QoS 队列映射错误。原代码使用 (skb->priority - 1) % NUM_QUEUES，当 skb->priority 为 0（默认未分类流量）时，无符号减法下溢为 UINT_MAX，导致普通 best-effort 包被错误地映射到最高优先级 QoS 队列，引发 QoS 反转，使 VoIP、游戏等真实高优先级流被饿死。修复方法去掉 -1 偏移，直接使用 skb->priority % NUM_QUEUES，使 priority 0 对应队列 0（最低），符合 Linux 标准 sk_prio→HW 队列映射。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
