      "id": 14637139,
      "title": "[v3,1/2] net/sched: dualpi2: fix GSO backlog accounting",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260619151447.223640-1-b1n@b1n.io",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619151447.223640-1-b1n@b1n.io/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619151447.223640-1-b1n@b1n.io/mbox/",
      "hash": "b59bb668f743a6c6c4331340206b56b0e7618987",
      "commitRef": "05ed733b65ab977dd931e7f7ac0f62fdb81205c2",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Xingquan Liu",
      "date": "2026-06-19T15:13:47",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 net/sched 中 dualpi2 qdisc 的 GSO 段拆分后向父 qdisc 的 backlog 计数错误。当 dualpi2 将一个 GSO skb 拆分为 N 个段并入队时，原代码向父 qdisc 多传播了一份计数，导致父 qdisc 的 qlen 比实际入队包数大 1。当父 qdisc 为 QFQ 时，该多余计数使 qlen 非零但无活跃类，qfq_choose_next_agg() 返回 NULL，触发 NULL 指针解引用。修复方案借鉴 tbf_segment() 和 taprio 的做法：只统计成功入队的段数，用 qdisc_tree_reduce_backlog() 补偿原始 skb 与实际段数之差，并在至少有一个段入队时返回 NET_XMIT_SUCCESS。",
      "tags": [
        "包处理",
        "性能",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14636434,
      "title": "[net,14/15] batman-adv: tvlv: enforce 2-byte alignment",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260619070045.438101-15-sw@simonwunderlich.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-15-sw@simonwunderlich.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-15-sw@simonwunderlich.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "a7116e340561eaa805d9572dce5e60dc5ab5de8e",
      "commitRef": "32a6799255525d6ea4da0f7e9e0e521ad9560a46",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Simon Wunderlich",
      "date": "2026-06-19T07:00:44",
      "summary": "该补丁针对 batman-adv 网状网络协议，强制聚合 OGM（Originator Message）包中 TVLV 字段的 2 字节对齐。由于聚合 OGM 的后续字段访问假设至少 2 字节对齐，若 tvlv_len 为奇数会导致后续 OGM 从奇数偏移开始，在严格对齐架构（如 ARM）上触发未对齐访问异常。补丁在 bat_iv_ogm 和 bat_v_ogm 的聚合包校验函数中添加 tvlv_len 奇偶性检查，拒绝 tvlv_len 为奇数的畸形包，避免未对齐访问问题，属于包处理层的安全加固。",
      "tags": [
        "包处理",
        "驱动",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14636431,
      "title": "[net,10/15] batman-adv: tp_meter: handle overlapping packets",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260619070045.438101-11-sw@simonwunderlich.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-11-sw@simonwunderlich.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-11-sw@simonwunderlich.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "9682136f082c8101a0f84e1b29df8ad8df52718b",
      "commitRef": "cbde75c38b21f022891525078622587ad557b7c1",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Simon Wunderlich",
      "date": "2026-06-19T07:00:40",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 batman-adv 网状网协议吞吐量测试工具（tp_meter）在处理重叠数据包时的逻辑缺陷。当传输过程中包大小发生变化时，重传的数据包可能出现序列号重叠，导致接收端精确比较 seqno 时产生误判。补丁将 `batadv_tp_handle_out_of_order()` 的参数从 skb 改为显式的 seqno 和 payload_len，并改为检查新包的序列号范围（seqno 到 seqno+payload_len）是否与已存储范围有重叠而非严格相等，从而正确处理变长包的重叠场景，避免误丢或误确认包。",
      "tags": [
        "路由",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14636425,
      "title": "[net,08/15] batman-adv: tp_meter: annotate last_recv_time access with READ/WRITE_ONCE",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260619070045.438101-9-sw@simonwunderlich.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-9-sw@simonwunderlich.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-9-sw@simonwunderlich.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "94b1b9d3296862124c815cb74b61e99accc17f06",
      "commitRef": "d67c728f07fca2ee6ffdc6dd4421cf2e8691f4d1",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Simon Wunderlich",
      "date": "2026-06-19T07:00:38",
      "summary": "该补丁针对 batman-adv 网状网络协议的吞吐量测试模块（tp_meter），对其 receiver 端 last_recv_time 字段的读写操作添加 READ_ONCE/WRITE_ONCE 注解。由于该字段在多线程/中断上下文中被并发访问，但缺乏统一的锁保护，编译器优化可能导致数据竞争。修改涉及 receiver shutdown 定时器中读取该字段判断超时，以及初始化接收会话时写入当前 jiffies 值的三处位置，使用内存访问宏保证读取和写入的原子性，防止 tearing 和编译器重排序引发的 race condition。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14636430,
      "title": "[net,05/15] batman-adv: frag: avoid underflow of TTL",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260619070045.438101-6-sw@simonwunderlich.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-6-sw@simonwunderlich.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-6-sw@simonwunderlich.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "3f8399baf05e243dcdd382b5fef8639341a88a80",
      "commitRef": "493d9d2528e1a09b090e4b37f0f553def7bd5ce9",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Simon Wunderlich",
      "date": "2026-06-19T07:00:35",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 batman-adv 网格协议分片转发路径中 TTL 字段未实际检查的问题。在 batadv_frag_skb_fwd() 中，当分片包总大小超过 MTU 需要转发时，之前只递减 TTL 而不做检查，可能导致 TTL 下溢（underflow）仍被转发。补丁在尝试转发前增加 `packet->ttl < 2` 的判断，若 TTL 不足则直接释放 skb 并返回 NET_RX_DROP，使分片转发行为与未分片的单播包保持一致，防止分片包在网络中无限制传播。",
      "tags": [
        "路由",
        "网桥",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14636463,
      "title": "[net,04/15] batman-adv: frag: ensure fragment is writable before modifying TTL",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260619070045.438101-5-sw@simonwunderlich.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-5-sw@simonwunderlich.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-5-sw@simonwunderlich.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "c40dc168546149774bae27d1738a7b5940e5d672",
      "commitRef": "b7293c6e8c15b2db77809b25cf8389e35331b27a",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Simon Wunderlich",
      "date": "2026-06-19T07:00:34",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 batman-adv 网格协议中 batadv_frag_skb_fwd() 函数在修改 skb TTL 字段前未确保数据可写的问题。batman-adv 在写入 skb 之前应保证其拥有独立副本或通过 skb_cow() 复制共享数据，但原代码直接修改共享 skb 的 TTL，可能导致其他使用者读到被破坏的数据。补丁在修改 TTL 前调用 skb_cow()，同时为函数新增 rx_result 输出参数以便调用方获知转发结果是成功还是丢弃。属于 batman-adv 分片转发路径的健壮性修复。",
      "tags": [
        "路由",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 14636460,
      "title": "[net,02/15] batman-adv: ensure bcast is writable before modifying TTL",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260619070045.438101-3-sw@simonwunderlich.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-3-sw@simonwunderlich.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260619070045.438101-3-sw@simonwunderlich.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "1faef049b5669a50a85f8c69e9c37d7279c0350c",
      "commitRef": "4cd6d3a4b96a8576f1fed8f9f9f17c2dc2978e0c",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Simon Wunderlich",
      "date": "2026-06-19T07:00:32",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 batman-adv 网状网协议中广播包处理时可能修改共享 skb 的问题。在 batadv_recv_bcast_packet 函数中，在对广播包 TTL 进行递减修改之前，增加了 skb_cow() 调用，确保 skb 数据区可写（必要时复制私有副本），避免对其他模块共享的缓冲区进行写操作。修复了 commit 3f69339 引入的 per-interface 广播队列后，可能因直接修改 skb 而影响共享缓冲区的隐患，属于包处理路径的内存安全修正。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
